This Privacy Policy describes how your information is handled when you use our mobile application ("the App"). We are committed to ensuring that your privacy is protected.

1. Information We Collect and Process
Our App is designed with privacy in mind. We do not require you to create an account, log in, or provide personal identification information (such as your name or email address) to use the core features.

API Data (NEA PSI & Weather): The App fetches live environmental and air quality data directly from official public sources (such as the Singapore National Environment Agency / data.gov.sg APIs). This process only involves transmitting your device's network request to public endpoints; no personal user data is sent or stored on external servers in connection with these requests.

Local Device Storage (Room Database): The App stores historical air quality readings, user preferences (such as dark mode settings, selected notification thresholds, and UI configurations) locally on your device using an on-device Room Database. This data remains on your device and is not transmitted to us or any third parties.

Device State & Push Notifications: If you enable air quality push alerts, the App utilizes local device notification services to alert you when PSI thresholds are met. Notification tokens or preferences are managed locally or via standard platform push services.

2. Advertising and Monetization (Google Ads)
To keep the App completely free to use, we display banner advertisements provided by Google AdMob.

Ad Personalization & SDKs: Google AdMob may use device identifiers, advertising IDs, and network information to serve relevant ads. Google’s use of advertising data is governed by the Google Privacy Policy.

You can manage your ad personalization preferences directly within your device's Google account or operating system settings.

3. Data Sharing and Disclosure
We do not sell, trade, or rent your personal information to third parties. We may only share non-personal, aggregated, or anonymized technical data with trusted third-party service providers (such as Google AdMob) strictly for the purpose of operating and displaying advertisements within the App.

4. Data Security & Retention
No Server-Side Collection: Because air quality data is fetched in real-time from public APIs and cached locally on your device, we do not maintain a central database containing your personal activity or location history.

Security: We value your trust in providing data locally, but remember that no method of electronic storage or transmission over the internet is 100% secure.

5. Children’s Privacy
Our App is a general audience tool designed to provide public environmental and weather information for Singapore. We do not knowingly solicit or collect personal information from children under the age of 13.

6. Your Data Rights & App Deletion
Because personal preferences and historical logs are stored locally on your device:

You can clear all stored historical data and cached entries at any time by clearing the App's storage or data via your Android device settings.

You can completely remove all data associated with the App by simply uninstalling it.

7. Changes to This Privacy Policy
We may update our Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page with an updated "Last Updated" date. You are advised to review this Privacy Policy periodically for any changes.

